    {
      "name": "semantic-private-citation",
      "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"YAML title\"\ndate: 2026-08-26\n---\n\n#+begin meta\ntitle: Canonical title\n#+end meta\n\n@@project(active) [Private plan] {\n  owner: hidden\n}\n\n@@part [Foundations]\n@@section(sub) [Operators] {id=sec:operators}\n# Markdown child\n\n#+begin theorem Case \\(x>0\\)\nVisible \\(x_1\\) @@tag[key] and @@cite(refs) [Ada; Turing] {locator=\"pp. 2, 4\", prefix=\"see\", suffix=\".\"}.\n#+end theorem",
      "options": {
        "citationKeyMap": {
          "refs\u0000Ada": "refs:Ada",
          "refs\u0000Turing": "refs:Turing"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "meta": {
          "title": "Canonical title",
          "date": "2026-08-26"
        },
        "markdown": "\n\n\n# Foundations\n### Operators {#sec:operators}\n\n\n```{=latex}\n\\subparagraph{Markdown child}\n```\n\n\n\n\n\n```{=latex}\n\\begin{theorem}[Case \\(x>0\\)]\n```\n\n\nVisible `\\(x_1\\)`{=latex} `\\hypertarget{key}{}`{=latex} and `see \\cite[pp. 2, 4]{refs:Ada,refs:Turing}.`{=latex}.\n\n\n```{=latex}\n\\end{theorem}\n```\n\n",
        "warnings": [],
        "features": {
          "usesSideComment": false,
          "usesTikz": false
        }
      }
    },
